# Git
.git/

# dist/unotusk-installer.tar.gz(.sha256) is committed intentionally — Vercel
# serves it at install.unotusk.com/dist/... for bootstrap/install.sh to fetch
# from a private repo without GitHub auth. Rebuilt by scripts/release.sh.

